    "text": "FIG. 4. 2D extension of critical topological photonics. (a, b)Single-particle entanglement spectra of the extended QWZ model at λ = 1 for (a) the conventional critical point M = 3 and (b) the critical topological point M = −1. The finite fre- quency direction contains Nf = 40 unit cells, the momentum kx is sampled with Nk = 800, and the horizontal axis is mea- sured relative to the gap-closing momentum, δkx = kx − k. with k = 0 for M = 3 and k = π for M = −1. The color indicates the mean frequency position of the entanglement eigenstate. (c, d) Time-averaged probability density ρ(x, y) of the same edge-localized Gaussian wavepacket evolved in a 50 × 50 open lattice.",
